title: 1922 Presidential Election 
subtitle: The first presidential election of our young Republic.
view-if: year = 1922 and month >= 2
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
tags: event
face-image: img/Jozef-Pilsudski-Polish-soldiers.webp
on-arrival: {!
for (var party of Q.parties) {
    Q[party + '_pres_votes'] = Math.round(((Q[party + '_sj'] + Q[party + '_sn']) / 2) * 10) / 10;
}
Q.witos_votes = 0;

Q.narutowicz_votes = 0;
Q.daszynski_votes = 0;
Q.wojciechowski_votes = 0;
Q.courtenay_votes = 0;
Q.zamoyski_votes = 0;

Q.endorsement_daszynski = 0;
Q.psl_l_choice = 'Narutowicz';
Q.psl_w_choice = 'Narutowicz';
Q.psl_p_choice = 'Wojciechowski';
Q.npr_choice = 'Wojciechowski';
Q.pps_choice = '0';
Q.kpp_choice = '0';
Q.bmn_choice = 'Courtenay';
Q.other_choice = 'Courtenay';
Q.chzjn_choice = 'Zamoyski';

!}

=  1922 Presidential Election

Its time to view the candidates. Now, <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span> is expected to run after calls for him to contend from moderates, <span style="color: #c00000;">socialists</span>, and even some right-wing followe- what? <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span> isnt running? 

It seems <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Marshal Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span> has decided not to run in these presidential elections, instead, most believe he will attempt to rally the **<span style="color: #CCC;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">ish</span>** parties  towards a unity candidate he supports.

After his decision to not put forward a candidacy, many parties have been left scrambling to put forward a candidate that is **not** <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span>, due to this decision coming close to the presidential elections.  Now, lets see..

- @who

@who
title: Who will be the successor of <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span>?
subtitle: Good question.

Without a unifying figure such as <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span> around, many fear the ChZJN might win the presidency, however, <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span> must have a plan, right? He wouldnt have dropped out without having a plan. Yes..

Now, from all these possible candidates, the one that is Piłsudski's first choice is..

- @witos

@witos
title: Witos Wincenty?
face-image: img/portraits/WitosWincenty.jpeg

<span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Witos Wincenty<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/WitosWincenty.jpeg">Member of the PSL-P </br></br> Previous Prime-Minister</span></span>, a moderate and leader of the PSL-P, has been suggested as a unity candidate agaisnt the ChZJN by <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span>, however he has declined, and <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span> starts searching for someone else. Now, who is second on his list..

- @narutowicz

@narutowicz
title: Gabriel Narutowicz.
face-image: img/portraits/NarutowiczGabriel.jpg

<span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Gabriel Narutowitcz<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/Narutowicz.jpeg">Minister of Foreign Affairs </br></br> Formed Minister of Public Works </span></span>, a independent,  has been suggested by <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span> as a unity candidate agaisnt the ChZJN, after <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Wincenty<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/WitosWincenty.jpeg">Member of the PSL-P </br></br> refused. However, he still has not officially agreed to this.

 However, <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Narutowitcz<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/Narutowicz.jpeg">Minister of Foreign Affairs </br></br> Formed Minister of Public Works </span></span>  has still not agreed, and <span class="wide_tooltip-wrap">Piłsudski<span class="wide_tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/PilsudskiJozef.jpg">Józef Piłsudski </br></br> Marshal Of Poland</span></span> will have to convince him.. now, lets see..

- @narutoyay
  
@narutoyay
title: Narutowicz accepts!
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/Narutowicz_Pilsudski.jpg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

With Narutowicz nominated to replace Piłsudski can he expect the Polish Moderates throw their support for him?

For better or worse, Narutowicz candidacy is only supported by the PSL-L and PSL-W.

- @candidate

@candidate
title: View the other running candidates

- @zamoyski
- @courtenay
